---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CTASection from "../components/CTASection.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site-config";
import selfie from "../assets/selfie.jpeg";
---

<Layout title="About" description="Colter Garrison, a web developer based in Hood River, OR, building sites for Columbia Gorge businesses.">
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
		<h1 class="font-head text-4xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-5xl">About</h1>

		<div class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
			<Image
				src={selfie}
				alt="Colter Garrison holding his white dog Ožujsko under string lights"
				widths={[128, 176, 256, 352]}
				sizes="(min-width: 640px) 11rem, 8rem"
				format="avif"
				class="float-right mb-3 ml-4 h-32 w-32 rounded-xl object-cover sm:ml-6 sm:h-44 sm:w-44"
			/>
			<p>
				I'm Colter, a web developer based in {siteConfig.location}. I build and maintain
				websites for wineries, breweries, and other hospitality businesses across the
				Gorge.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-5">
				I've spent the last decade in and around the Gorge. Before web development, I worked as an
				EMT and later as a nurse, which meant a lot of time showing up for people on
				their hardest days and learning to communicate clearly when it really mattered.
				I also spent time behind the counter at 2 Towns Ciderhouse, pouring pints and
				getting a feel for what makes someone want to come back to a place. Somewhere
				in there I found my way into front-end development, and I've been building
				websites professionally ever since.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-5">
				I bring all of that here. I know this area, I know what it's like to work in
				hospitality, and I care about getting the details right, so your site ends up
				looking like your business, not a template with your logo dropped in.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-5">
				If you want to see the work before you reach out, the <a href="/portfolio" class="font-semibold text-accent hover:underline">portfolio</a> page has live sites you can click through right now.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-semibold">
			<a href={siteConfig.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">
				LinkedIn →
			</a>
			<a href={siteConfig.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">
				GitHub →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<CTASection heading="Ready to talk about your site?" />
</Layout>
